01:40:34.200 --> 01:40:39.200
It appears that those include both anti-stealth radar systems

01:40:39.560 --> 01:40:43.080
as well as ground-based interceptors

01:40:43.080 --> 01:40:44.640
that can independently track

01:40:44.640 --> 01:40:46.920
and take down stealth bombers and stealth fighters.

01:40:46.920 --> 01:40:48.200
Now, what's interesting to me

01:40:48.200 --> 01:40:50.520
