to have a 500 kilometer detection range.

01:40:53.360 --> 01:40:54.200
It's amazing.

01:40:54.200 --> 01:40:55.120
Isn't it though?

01:40:55.120 --> 01:40:57.680
I mean, and that eliminates the ability

01:40:57.680 --> 01:40:59.480
of what Trump did last June,

01:40:59.480 --> 01:41:02.040
bombing Fordo and others.

01:41:02.040 --> 01:41:04.680
But there's one more thing that wraps all this together, John,

01:41:04.680 --> 01:41:08.400
which is that if we were to lose a stealth bomber,

01:41:09.240 --> 01:41:11.080
I don't think we could replace it now

01:41:11.080 --> 01:41:13.160
because it uses so many rare earths

01:41:13.160 --> 01:41:14.800
and it also uses graphite.

01:41:14.800 --> 01:41:19.720
And China has a near 100% global control

01:41:19.720 --> 01:41:22.640
over the graphite industry.

01:41:22.640 --> 01:41:26.880
And the US is 100% import dependent on graphite

01:41:26.880 --> 01:41:28.560
and many of the rare metals.

01:41:28.560 --> 01:41:31.000
So unless we have stockpiles sitting around somewhere,

01:41:31.000 --> 01:41:33.560
if we start losing stealth fighters or stealth bombers

01:41:33.560 --> 01:41:37.560
or even F-35s, I'm not sure how those can be replaced.

01:41:37.560 --> 01:41:38.560
What do you think?

01:41:39.640 --> 01:41:41.440
I have to agree with you.

01:41:41.440 --> 01:41:43.200
If we were to lose a stealth fighter,

01:41:43.200 --> 01:41:45.600
it would be just devastating.

01:41:45.600 --> 01:41:46.920
And if this is true,

01:41:46.920 --> 01:41:48.600
what we're hearing about the Chinese

01:41:48.600 --> 01:41:51.720
and Chinese military shipments to Iran,

01:41:51.720 --> 01:41:54.360
the Iranians are gonna be far better prepared

01:41:54.360 --> 01:41:56.200
than we've given them credit for being.

01:41:56.640 --> 01:41:58.680
The Iranian policy as we've seen it

01:41:58.680 --> 01:41:59.880
over the last several years

01:41:59.880 --> 01:42:03.040
has been something called strategic patience.

01:42:03.040 --> 01:42:05.760
That's what they've called it, strategic patience.

01:42:05.760 --> 01:42:08.520
They've been willing to take blows from the Israelis.

01:42:08.520 --> 01:42:11.240
They've been willing to just sit by

01:42:11.240 --> 01:42:15.880
as literally their entire top military leadership

01:42:15.880 --> 01:42:19.440
was taken out in a series of Israeli attacks.

01:42:19.440 --> 01:42:21.720
All of their, not all,

01:42:21.720 --> 01:42:25.280
almost all of their top nuclear scientists

01:42:25.320 --> 01:42:27.920
have been assassinated one at a time,

01:42:27.920 --> 01:42:31.160
close in assassinations in Tehran,

01:42:31.160 --> 01:42:34.440
as well as overseas when they're attending conferences

01:42:34.440 --> 01:42:38.320
or meetings, for example, and they don't retaliate.

01:42:38.320 --> 01:42:42.400
Well, the Iranian government is far more patient

01:42:42.400 --> 01:42:43.640
than the Iranian people.

01:42:43.640 --> 01:42:47.600
And the Iranian people have been demanding retaliation.

01:42:47.600 --> 01:42:49.000
We keep getting attacked.

01:42:49.000 --> 01:42:50.680
What are you gonna do about it?

01:42:50.680 --> 01:42:53.280
And so the government is in the position now

01:42:53.280 --> 01:42:56.400
where it's going to have to fight that fight

01:42:56.400 --> 01:43:01.160
if the Israelis and or the Americans launch something new.

01:43:01.160 --> 01:43:03.240
And if they do launch something new

01:43:03.240 --> 01:43:06.400
and the Iranians really do put up a fight

01:43:06.400 --> 01:43:09.040
that might include the use of Chinese technology,

