Right, because they're not invading their neighbors.

01:43:21.200 --> 01:43:22.360
Then what do we do?

01:43:22.360 --> 01:43:23.200
We're screwed.

01:43:23.200 --> 01:43:24.360
Exactly, they're not invading their neighbors.

01:43:24.360 --> 01:43:26.040
They're not invading their neighbors, right?

01:43:26.040 --> 01:43:29.880
Like I say all the time that the American defense budget

