Because we've convinced ourselves

01:44:03.880 --> 01:44:06.120
that we have to be the policemen of the world,

01:44:06.120 --> 01:44:09.360
whether the world wants it or likes it or not.

01:44:09.360 --> 01:44:11.720
And why don't we have bullet trains, for example?

