But those expenditures are not even efficient, right?

01:44:14.760 --> 01:44:15.600
No, they're not.

01:44:15.600 --> 01:44:18.000
Because most of that's waste and fraud and grift.

01:44:18.000 --> 01:44:18.840
Yes it is.

01:44:18.960 --> 01:44:20.680
I mean, look at how Russia,

01:44:20.680 --> 01:44:23.160
with a fraction of the US military budget

01:44:23.160 --> 01:44:26.760
can come up with not only the Kinzal hypersonic missiles

01:44:26.760 --> 01:44:28.960
