01:44:28.960 --> 01:44:29.800
You're exactly right.

01:44:29.800 --> 01:44:33.200
Which is revolutionary and using non-nuclear

01:44:33.200 --> 01:44:35.720
high energy kinetic impacts

01:44:35.720 --> 01:44:37.800
that do not violate any kind of nuclear treaties.

01:44:37.800 --> 01:44:39.920
Not that any of those are even enforced anymore

