since recently.

01:44:41.240 --> 01:44:42.560
But you see what I'm saying.

01:44:42.560 --> 01:44:44.920
I mean, with 1.5 trillion dollars

01:44:44.920 --> 01:44:47.800
we should have like Star Trek technology,

01:44:47.840 --> 01:44:49.560
photon torpedoes or something.

01:44:49.560 --> 01:44:50.680
Exactly right.

01:44:50.680 --> 01:44:52.960
Instead we have garbage.

01:44:52.960 --> 01:44:55.000
You know, people say all the time,

01:44:55.000 --> 01:44:57.600
well, you don't know what DARPA's working on.

01:44:57.600 --> 01:44:59.400
And I always say, but that's the point.

01:44:59.400 --> 01:45:00.760
Whatever DARPA's working on,

