01:46:36.080 --> 01:46:40.000
Well, these cars are a third, a fourth

01:46:40.000 --> 01:46:41.760
of the cost of a Tesla.

01:46:41.800 --> 01:46:43.880
And they're better than Tesla.

01:46:43.880 --> 01:46:46.640
And the design is certainly more attractive.

01:46:46.640 --> 01:46:48.200
But we're not allowed to have them.

01:46:48.200 --> 01:46:50.080
And critically, I'm glad you brought this up

01:46:50.080 --> 01:46:51.400
because the battery tech now

01:46:51.400 --> 01:46:52.560
that's just being announced,

01:46:52.560 --> 01:46:54.600
the sodium ion chemistry,

01:46:54.600 --> 01:46:58.560
as well as the, I think BYD's focus on sulfide chemistry.

01:46:58.560 --> 01:47:02.080
But we're talking about a million miles of usage.

01:47:02.080 --> 01:47:03.520
I'm not in one charge, obviously,

01:47:03.520 --> 01:47:06.720
but obviously thousands of chargers over time.

01:47:06.720 --> 01:47:08.920
In other words, the car is gonna last,

01:47:08.920 --> 01:47:11.000
I mean, the battery's gonna last longer than the car.

01:47:11.000 --> 01:47:13.600
Oh yeah, the seats will wear out before the car does.

01:47:13.600 --> 01:47:14.440
100%.

01:47:14.440 --> 01:47:16.880
But those batteries will go into military drones.

01:47:16.880 --> 01:47:18.520
They will go into military robots.

01:47:18.520 --> 01:47:20.680
They will go into all kinds of other equipment.

01:47:20.680 --> 01:47:23.280
And the US won't have that technology.

01:47:23.280 --> 01:47:25.720
We are behind the curve in so many...

01:47:25.720 --> 01:47:27.480
This is why you can hear frustration in my voice

01:47:27.480 --> 01:47:28.720
because I'm an American.

01:47:28.720 --> 01:47:29.560
I love America.

01:47:29.560 --> 01:47:31.040
I want America to do well.

01:47:31.040 --> 01:47:32.960
And I'm frustrated that we seem to be,

01:47:32.960 --> 01:47:33.800
pardon my language,

01:47:33.800 --> 01:47:36.960
just pissing away every opportunity to be a leader.

01:47:36.960 --> 01:47:39.240
We're just sitting back with fraud and waste

01:47:39.240 --> 01:47:42.200
and cover-ups and not being the America

01:47:42.200 --> 01:47:43.840
that we were meant to be.

01:47:43.840 --> 01:47:45.840
That's the way I see it.

01:47:45.840 --> 01:47:48.040
I think you're 100% right.

01:47:48.040 --> 01:47:48.880
I really do.

01:47:48.880 --> 01:47:50.280
I think you're 100% right.

01:47:50.280 --> 01:47:54.360
